{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Unlimited funding for police for any resources they need",
        "additional_details": "As we rely on the police for safety and security, we believe it is only fit that they should have unlimited funding when needed.\r\n \r\nIn order for the public to feel safer and securer during day and night, we think our police forces should have unlimited funding.\r\n \r\nCriminals and victimisers are none stop; and it is difficult for police to see everything or be more active if they haven\u2019t got the resources of funding we think they should be entitled to in order to prevent anything from happening or take action when needed.",
        "background": "I ask that police have unlimited funding in order to be able to act when needed on public safety; also for anything they should need in their line of work.",
